==In the manga==
[[File:Stone Town EToP.png|thumb|250px|Stone Town in [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]]]]
===The Electric Tale of Pikachu===
Stone Town appeared in ''[[ET06|To Evolve or Not to Evolve, That is the Question!]]''. In this [[canon]], it is located on {{ma|Dream Island}}. {{OBP|Ash Ketchum|EToP|Ash}}, {{an|Misty}} and {{an|Brock}} travelled there so that Misty could purchase a [[Water Stone]] for her {{TP|Misty|Poliwhirl}}. Although she could not afford a stone, she was given one by [[Mikey]], who gave his set of [[Evolution stone]]s away because he was being pressured to evolve his {{p|Eevee}} to join the exclusive club "[[Knights of the E Stone]]", which requires its members to own a Pokémon evolved by means of an Evolution stone. Ash helped Mikey to defeat [[Eevee brothers|his older brothers]], allowing him to join the club without needing to evolve Eevee.
